    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abasinjilili abalayi bobukoosia bwaNyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mana olwa Kristo yasaalila mumubili, neenyu mwimanule amayililisio malala akeenako, mbu muleshenje okhumala tsindaalo etsishimutong'ela mumubili nimukholanga akobwikombi bwabandu ta; habula akokhwenya khwaNyasaye; shichila ousaaliliile mumubili abeetsanga naleshile obwonooni pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.1+1PE.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.1",
              "1PE.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsindaalo; tsieefwe etsiabira tsiakhuhela khulwa okhukholelamwo akokhwenya khwAbamahanga; okhuchendanga mubwilaasi, nobwikombi, nobumeesi, namasabo kobulangu, neminywo, nemilukha chiebifwanani, echili chiomusilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata bulaano, olwa mukhayanga okhwanguha ninabo halala okhwinjila mubushilaasi buno bwobwitaakuli ta, bamuhukanga nibamunyeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne balakalusia khukabwe imbeli wa oyo oubeetsanga niyeerecheeshe okhubayaasia abalamu nende abafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila kano niko akachila Injiili niyiilwatsilwa kata abafwa tsana, mbu mumubili bayaasibwe shinga abandu olwa bayaasibungwa, ne muroho babe mwoyo shinga Nyasaye olwa ali mwoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshihesi shiamakhuwa kosi shisitile ahambi; kho mube abarechelefu, nimwiruka, mbu musaayenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhushila kosi murekhwo omwoyo okhuheelananga; shichila obuheeli bufuunikha ebionoono ebinji muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinjisaninjie aharali okhubuuluula khwosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshihaanwa eshia buli mundu yesi yaheebwa shinga olwa shili, ashiikhoonyele nakhalabanila abashie, shinga olwa muli abasinjilili abalayi bobukoosia bwaNyasaye tsimbia tsiabwo tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi ouboola, abe shinga ouboola amasungo kaNyasaye; omundu yesi oukhalabana, akholenje shinga ouli namaani aka Nyasaye ahaananga; mbu mukosi Nyasaye aheebungwe oluyali khulwa Yesu Kristo, ouli omwene luyali nende obunyali, ebisoni nebisoni. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obusaalili bwomuKristayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwa banje, murahuka khukokhuteemwa khweenywe khwomulilo, okhumukwila mbu khumuchele, shinga olwa kali amakhuwa amacheni akamwikholakhwo, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne aha musanjilanilanga khukhusaalila khwaKristo, mwikhoye; mbu khukhufwimbulwa khwoluyalilwe nakhwo muliikhoya omwikhoyo omukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuba nimukondeshelwa khulwa eliira liaKristo, muli abeikhabi; shichila roho woluyali, niye Roho waNyasaye, ali khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi khwinywe aleshe okhusaalisibwa shichila nomwiri, kata omwibi, kata omukholi wetsimbii, kata omwiyinjisii mumakhuwa kabeene, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula omundu naba nasaalila shichila nomuKristayo, arafwimbwe omurwe tawe; nebutswa aheelesie Nyasaye oluyali muliira elo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba induukho yakhoola eya obuyaasii okhuchaachila enanzu waNyasaye; ne nibuba nibuchaakwa burio khwifwe, obumaliilishi bwa abo abarahulilanga injiili yaNyasaye ta bulaba burie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nikaba nikali amatinyu omulunjishi okhuhonibwa, oyo ouramuria Nyasaye ta, kata omwonooni, alanyoolekha nali heena? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niko akachila abasaalilanga okhwenya khwaNyasaye shinga olwa khuli, bare emioyo chiabwe mumakhono kOmulonji ouli omwisiikwa, nibakholanga amalayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
